abstract: >-
  A standard-library Python command-line toolkit and GitHub Action that turns
  per-SKU demand history into verified inventory-policy analysis, including
  ABC-XYZ classification, demand-pattern profiling, MASE-backtested forecasts,
  safety stock, reorder points, EOQ, and policy replay.
keywords:
  - inventory
  - supply chain
  - forecasting
  - safety stock
  - reorder point
  - operations
